{"kind":"rule","id":"job","title":"Master job queue","type":"queue","context":"master thread","notes":"Jobs carry a type and a callback. `iolink_main` switches on `job->type`; every case except `PD_EVENT` and `EXIT` runs `job->callback`. The CM and ODE wrappers pass the type through a parameter, so their callers are matched too. `job->type = …` in `iolink_main.c` covers the jobs posted without the helper (PD event, exit) and also matches the resets to `IOLINK_JOB_NONE`.","send":[{"call":"iolink_post_job_with_type_and_callback","key":3,"handler":4},{"call":"init_and_post_job","key":2,"handler":3,"files":["src/src/iolink_cm.c"]},{"call":"ode_SMI_rw_req","key":1,"files":["src/src/iolink_ode.c"]},{"call":"ode_SMI_DeviceReadWrite_req","key":6,"files":["src/src/iolink_ode.c"]},{"assign":"type","as":"key","files":["src/src/iolink_main.c"]}],"receive":[{"case":"IOLINK_JOB_.*","files":["src/src/iolink_main.c"]}]}
{"kind":"rule","id":"mbox","title":"Mailbox","type":"queue","notes":"The master has three mailboxes (`mbox` for submitted jobs, `mbox_avail` and `mbox_api_avail` as free-job pools). The handle is spelled `master->mbox` or `port->master->mbox`, so it cannot serve as a key; only the job mailbox is paired, by an anchored connection.","send":[{"call":"os_mbox_post"}],"receive":[{"call":"os_mbox_fetch"}]}
{"kind":"rule","id":"dl-event","title":"DL thread event","type":"event","context":"DL thread","notes":"`dl_main` waits on `dl->event` and tests each flag. Limited to the stack; the sample application uses `os_event_set` for its own events.","send":[{"call":"os_event_set","key":2,"files":["src/src/**"]}],"receive":[{"test":"IOLINK_(DL|PL)_EVENT(_.*)?","files":["src/src/**"]}]}
{"kind":"connection","id":"master-mbox","rule":"mbox","title":"Master job mailbox","context":"master thread","send":[{"file":"src/src/iolink_main.c","symbol":"iolink_post_job_with_type_and_callback"},{"file":"src/src/iolink_main.c","symbol":"iolink_post_job"},{"file":"src/src/iolink_main.c","symbol":"iolink_post_job_pd_event"},{"file":"src/src/iolink_main.c","symbol":"iolink_m_deinit"}],"receive":[{"file":"src/src/iolink_main.c","symbol":"iolink_main"}]}
